in that business, we also have some structural things that bring some value, tariff movements, etc, And then the point that you weren't alluding to, but I will say, we do look to divest -- to deploy capital, not divest, deploy capital in a way where we can bolt-on to existing assets…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/mplx-lp-mplx-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MPLX 2019 Q2","e":"mplx","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Gary R. Heminger","x":"First, we expect to streamline our capital expenditures focusing on the most attractive returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/01/mplx-lp-mplx-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MPLX 2019 Q3","e":"mplx","d":"2019-10-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Hennigan","x":"We have completed plans to streamline our growth capital expenditures, focusing on the most attractive returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/mplx-lp-mplx-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MPLX 2019 Q4","e":"mplx","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Hennigan","x":"We have since identified additional opportunities to further streamline our growth capital expenditures, focusing on the most attractive returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/mplx-lp-mplx-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MPLX 2020 Q1","e":"mplx","d":"2020-05-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Hennigan","x":"Last quarter we announced that we had identified additional opportunities to further streamline our growth capital expenditures, focusing on the most attractive returns, reducing our growth target to $1.5 billion.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/05/mplx-lp-mplx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MPLX 2020 Q2","e":"mplx","d":"2020-08-03","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Spiro Dounis","x":"And so, just wondering to what degree does MPLX contribute to that initiative going forward by way of its own asset closures, cost cuts, or even tariff cuts, just given that it's one of the main service providers for MPC.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/mplx-lp-mplx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MPLX 2020 Q2","e":"mplx","d":"2020-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Spiro Dounis","x":"There was a lot of focus around cost reduction further optimizing the refining portfolio beyond Martinez and Gallup.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/mplx-lp-mplx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"MPLX 2020 Q3","e":"mplx","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pamela K.M. Beall","x":"And then, we also announced the reduction in force that was across the enterprise, MPC and MPLX.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/mplx-lp-mplx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPLX 2020 Q3","e":"mplx","d":"2020-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pamela K.M. Beall","x":"And so, we have probably experienced more of the cost savings on the logistics and storage side of the business than we did in gathering and processing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/mplx-lp-mplx-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPLX 2020 Q4","e":"mplx","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Hennigan","x":"Our cost reduction efforts are particularly meaningful when you consider we have not compromised our commitment to safely operating our assets, protect the health and safety of our employees and support the communities in which we operate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/mplx-lp-mplx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPLX 2020 Q4","e":"mplx","d":"2021-02-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Hennigan","x":"…as everyone knows, we're not through with the pandemic yet, but once we establish post the pandemic, I think we're going to be in a mode where we're going to continue to grow earnings like we've said over time, or you continue to look at cost-cutting that we made is a major effort this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/02/mplx-lp-mplx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPLX 2021 Q2","e":"mplx","d":"2021-08-06","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Timothy J. Aydt","x":"I think at the end of the day, it's a balancing act for the producers and the mid-streamers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/mplx-lp-mplx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPLX 2021 Q2","e":"mplx","d":"2021-08-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Pamela K.M. Beall","x":"And then we also saw the benefit of lower costs related to some of the headcount reductions that took place in the fourth quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/06/mplx-lp-mplx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPLX 2021 Q3","e":"mplx","d":"2021-11-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Michael J. Hennigan","x":"These tailwinds, along with solid business performance and cost reduction efforts, have combined to result in just over $1 billion of cash flow available for deployment above our current capital spending and distribution requirements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/mplx-lp-mplx-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPLX 2025 Q4","e":"mplx","d":"2026-02-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Carl Hagedorn","x":"The increase was primarily driven by a $37 million from a revised FERC tariff issued in November and higher rates, partially offset by higher planned project-related expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/03/mplx-mplx-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,6509,0,0,0,5064,1090],[36,1,7222,0,0,0,5629,1213],[38,1,4855,0,0,0,3813,760